                                                "sense_id": "55f99012-59d6-3b43-8a8c-f377c6c8b05c",
                                                "text": "Molded by Mattel in forest green, this action figure was garbed in a removable yellow, sleeveless shawl. He is worth substantially more money if this filigree drapery is still intact."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28f121c0-bec1-4861-813d-3ffc25e347b7",
                                                "sense_id": "55f99012-59d6-3b43-8a8c-f377c6c8b05c",
                                                "text": "The interior melamine panels were designed to be easily removable for repair or future refurbishment, and the linoleum floor was for easy cleaning."
                                            }
